    "chunk_text": "e in \u00f0\u00e6re OC24A1 On \u00f0one XXIIII d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 \u00f0\u00e6s martyres tid \u00ferowung sancti Genesi, \u00f0one mon OC24A3 \u00de\u00e6s gemynd is mycel on twam burgum on twa healfa \u00fe\u00e6s flodes \u00f0e hatte Rodanum, \u00fe\u00e6t is OC24A6 In o\u00f0re birg is seo stow \u00fee he mid his blode gehalgode \u00fea hyne mon martyrode, in \u00f0\u00e6re OC24B1 On \u00f0one ilcan d\u00e6g bi\u00f0 XVI cempena tid, \u00f0a het Claudius se casere heafde beceorfan in OC24B4 Ond hie w\u00e6ron bli\u00f0ran to \u00f0am dea\u00f0e \u00feonne hy her on h\u00e6\u00f0engilde lifden. OC24B5 \u00deara cempena IIII w\u00e6ron nemned \u00feiosius ond Lucius ond Marcus ond Petrus. OC26A1 On \u00f0one XXVI d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es bi\u00f0 sancte Ceadweallan geleornes \u00fe\u00e6s biscopes. OC26A2 He w\u00e6s Ceaddan bro\u00f0or, ond sum halig mon geseah \u00fe\u00e6t he l\u00e6dde Ceaddan sawle mid OC26A5 Ceadde w\u00e6s biscop in Eastseaxum, ond hw\u00e6\u00f0ere his lichoma reste\u00f0 be nor\u00f0an gem\u00e6re in OC28A1 On \u00f0one XXVIII d\u00e6g \u00fe\u00e6s mon\u00f0es \u00feara apostola tid Simonis ond Thaddeos. OC28A2 Simonis w\u00e6s sancta Marian swystorsunu, Cristes modrian sunu, seo w\u00e6s nemned on OC28A5 \u00deonne w\u00e6s Thaddeos o\u00f0er noma Iudas. OC28A6 \u00d0as apostolas \u00e6fter Cristes upastigenesse gewiton on Persida m\u00e6g\u00f0e ond bodedon Cristes OC28A9 \u00de\u00e6r hy gedydon \u00f0\u00e6t cild sprecende \u00fe\u00e6t ne w\u00e6s anre",
